{"real": true, "dur": 110.32, "sent": [{"start": 0.16, "end": 1.9, "text": "How do you build a catalogue?", "words": [{"w": "How", "s": 0.16}, {"w": "do", "s": 0.44}, {"w": "you", "s": 0.6}, {"w": "build", "s": 0.8}, {"w": "a", "s": 1.14}, {"w": "catalogue?", "s": 1.34}]}, {"start": 2.4, "end": 8.74, "text": "I use three sources: the textbook, the teacher’s guide and the publisher’s unit tests.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 2.4}, {"w": "use", "s": 2.58}, {"w": "three", "s": 2.84}, {"w": "sources:", "s": 3.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.22}, {"w": "textbook,", "s": 4.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 5.36}, {"w": "teacher’s", "s": 5.52}, {"w": "guide", "s": 6.06}, {"w": "and", "s": 6.88}, {"w": "the", "s": 7.04}, {"w": "publisher’s", "s": 7.22}, {"w": "unit", "s": 8.02}, {"w": "tests.", "s": 8.38}]}, {"start": 9.66, "end": 15.34, "text": "For example, if a unit test asks for something, it counts as taught in that unit.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 9.66}, {"w": "example,", "s": 9.86}, {"w": "if", "s": 10.94}, {"w": "a", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "unit", "s": 11.28}, {"w": "test", "s": 11.66}, {"w": "asks", "s": 12.06}, {"w": "for", "s": 12.3}, {"w": "something,", "s": 12.52}, {"w": "it", "s": 13.44}, {"w": "counts", "s": 13.62}, {"w": "as", "s": 14.04}, {"w": "taught", "s": 14.28}, {"w": "in", "s": 14.64}, {"w": "that", "s": 14.84}, {"w": "unit.", "s": 15.06}]}, {"start": 15.82, "end": 22.48, "text": "So whenever I decide that something belongs in a particular unit, I need evidence from one of those three sources.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 15.82}, {"w": "whenever", "s": 16.28}, {"w": "I", "s": 16.86}, {"w": "decide", "s": 16.9}, {"w": "that", "s": 17.32}, {"w": "something", "s": 17.52}, {"w": "belongs", "s": 17.86}, {"w": "in", "s": 18.36}, {"w": "a", "s": 18.46}, {"w": "particular", "s": 18.58}, {"w": "unit,", "s": 19.18}, {"w": "I", "s": 20.0}, {"w": "need", "s": 20.08}, {"w": "evidence", "s": 20.36}, {"w": "from", "s": 20.82}, {"w": "one", "s": 21.04}, {"w": "of", "s": 21.18}, {"w": "those", "s": 21.34}, {"w": "three", "s": 21.7}, {"w": "sources.", "s": 21.98}]}, {"start": 23.34, "end": 27.04, "text": "In other words, I can’t just include something because I happen to know it.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 23.34}, {"w": "other", "s": 23.48}, {"w": "words,", "s": 23.68}, {"w": "I", "s": 24.38}, {"w": "can’t", "s": 24.5}, {"w": "just", "s": 24.76}, {"w": "include", "s": 25.02}, {"w": "something", "s": 25.44}, {"w": "because", "s": 25.82}, {"w": "I", "s": 26.28}, {"w": "happen", "s": 26.32}, {"w": "to", "s": 26.62}, {"w": "know", "s": 26.76}, {"w": "it.", "s": 26.94}]}, {"start": 27.44, "end": 28.98, "text": "Here are some examples.", "words": [{"w": "Here", "s": 27.44}, {"w": "are", "s": 27.7}, {"w": "some", "s": 27.94}, {"w": "examples.", "s": 28.22}]}, {"start": 28.98, "end": 45.26, "text": "“Quarter past” and “half past” aren’t in the French course, because the book tells the time as “nine fifteen” and “nine thirty.” On the other hand, “noon” and “midnight” are in, in Unit 2.", "words": [{"w": "“Quarter", "s": 28.98}, {"w": "past”", "s": 29.82}, {"w": "and", "s": 30.54}, {"w": "“half", "s": 30.64}, {"w": "past”", "s": 31.06}, {"w": "aren’t", "s": 31.84}, {"w": "in", "s": 32.56}, {"w": "the", "s": 32.68}, {"w": "French", "s": 32.82}, {"w": "course,", "s": 33.18}, {"w": "because", "s": 34.16}, {"w": "the", "s": 35.04}, {"w": "book", "s": 35.2}, {"w": "tells", "s": 35.5}, {"w": "the", "s": 35.82}, {"w": "time", "s": 35.98}, {"w": "as", "s": 36.42}, {"w": "“nine", "s": 36.66}, {"w": "fifteen”", "s": 37.54}, {"w": "and", "s": 38.5}, {"w": "“nine", "s": 38.6}, {"w": "thirty.”", "s": 39.0}, {"w": "On", "s": 40.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 40.58}, {"w": "other", "s": 40.74}, {"w": "hand,", "s": 40.98}, {"w": "“noon”", "s": 41.3}, {"w": "and", "s": 42.36}, {"w": "“midnight”", "s": 42.48}, {"w": "are", "s": 43.5}, {"w": "in,", "s": 43.76}, {"w": "in", "s": 44.44}, {"w": "Unit", "s": 44.66}, {"w": "2.", "s": 45.24}]}, {"start": 45.8, "end": 53.32, "text": "Also, whenever the book introduces a verb, learners practise it with all nine subject pronouns.", "words": [{"w": "Also,", "s": 45.8}, {"w": "whenever", "s": 46.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 47.2}, {"w": "book", "s": 47.34}, {"w": "introduces", "s": 47.94}, {"w": "a", "s": 48.74}, {"w": "verb,", "s": 48.86}, {"w": "learners", "s": 49.84}, {"w": "practise", "s": 50.42}, {"w": "it", "s": 50.84}, {"w": "with", "s": 51.1}, {"w": "all", "s": 51.46}, {"w": "nine", "s": 51.82}, {"w": "subject", "s": 52.26}, {"w": "pronouns.", "s": 52.74}]}, {"start": 53.84, "end": 66.16, "text": "And in Chinese, Lesson 11 teaches the time with its own words for “a quarter,” “three quarters” and “half.” So the Chinese course will teach them.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 53.84}, {"w": "in", "s": 54.12}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 54.3}, {"w": "Lesson", "s": 55.54}, {"w": "11", "s": 55.98}, {"w": "teaches", "s": 56.76}, {"w": "the", "s": 57.24}, {"w": "time", "s": 57.44}, {"w": "with", "s": 57.92}, {"w": "its", "s": 58.12}, {"w": "own", "s": 58.42}, {"w": "words", "s": 58.7}, {"w": "for", "s": 59.4}, {"w": "“a", "s": 59.5}, {"w": "quarter,”", "s": 59.78}, {"w": "“three", "s": 60.3}, {"w": "quarters”", "s": 61.2}, {"w": "and", "s": 62.28}, {"w": "“half.”", "s": 62.42}, {"w": "So", "s": 63.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 64.14}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 64.3}, {"w": "course", "s": 64.84}, {"w": "will", "s": 65.319}, {"w": "teach", "s": 65.56}, {"w": "them.", "s": 65.92}]}, {"start": 66.76, "end": 68.8, "text": "Now, I have to be honest here.", "words": [{"w": "Now,", "s": 66.76}, {"w": "I", "s": 67.52}, {"w": "have", "s": 67.58}, {"w": "to", "s": 67.76}, {"w": "be", "s": 67.88}, {"w": "honest", "s": 68.06}, {"w": "here.", "s": 68.54}]}, {"start": 69.28, "end": 74.24, "text": "When I checked the first French version against the book, it went way past it.", "words": [{"w": "When", "s": 69.28}, {"w": "I", "s": 69.7}, {"w": "checked", "s": 69.86}, {"w": "the", "s": 70.16}, {"w": "first", "s": 70.32}, {"w": "French", "s": 70.6}, {"w": "version", "s": 70.96}, {"w": "against", "s": 71.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 72.04}, {"w": "book,", "s": 72.2}, {"w": "it", "s": 72.96}, {"w": "went", "s": 73.18}, {"w": "way", "s": 73.5}, {"w": "past", "s": 73.78}, {"w": "it.", "s": 74.1}]}, {"start": 75.18, "end": 79.94, "text": "For instance, twelve colours in the first unit, when the book has two.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 75.18}, {"w": "instance,", "s": 75.4}, {"w": "twelve", "s": 76.48}, {"w": "colours", "s": 76.84}, {"w": "in", "s": 77.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 77.52}, {"w": "first", "s": 77.66}, {"w": "unit,", "s": 78.04}, {"w": "when", "s": 78.8}, {"w": "the", "s": 79.0}, {"w": "book", "s": 79.14}, {"w": "has", "s": 79.38}, {"w": "two.", "s": 79.68}]}, {"start": 79.94, "end": 84.54, "text": "“Why” taught four units before the book gets to it.", "words": [{"w": "“Why”", "s": 79.94}, {"w": "taught", "s": 81.68}, {"w": "four", "s": 82.12}, {"w": "units", "s": 82.48}, {"w": "before", "s": 83.12}, {"w": "the", "s": 83.54}, {"w": "book", "s": 83.68}, {"w": "gets", "s": 83.96}, {"w": "to", "s": 84.26}, {"w": "it.", "s": 84.42}]}, {"start": 84.96, "end": 90.68, "text": "And a pre-test that marked learners on “half past two,” which the book never teaches.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 84.96}, {"w": "a", "s": 85.1}, {"w": "pre-test", "s": 85.22}, {"w": "that", "s": 86.02}, {"w": "marked", "s": 86.26}, {"w": "learners", "s": 86.78}, {"w": "on", "s": 87.26}, {"w": "“half", "s": 87.44}, {"w": "past", "s": 87.88}, {"w": "two,”", "s": 88.26}, {"w": "which", "s": 88.98}, {"w": "the", "s": 89.26}, {"w": "book", "s": 89.4}, {"w": "never", "s": 89.9}, {"w": "teaches.", "s": 90.2}]}, {"start": 91.66, "end": 95.18, "text": "Every one of those choices seemed helpful at the time.", "words": [{"w": "Every", "s": 91.66}, {"w": "one", "s": 91.98}, {"w": "of", "s": 92.14}, {"w": "those", "s": 92.28}, {"w": "choices", "s": 92.56}, {"w": "seemed", "s": 93.58}, {"w": "helpful", "s": 94.02}, {"w": "at", "s": 94.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 94.76}, {"w": "time.", "s": 94.88}]}, {"start": 95.98, "end": 99.66, "text": "But learners were being marked on things the course hadn’t taught them.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 95.98}, {"w": "learners", "s": 96.22}, {"w": "were", "s": 96.68}, {"w": "being", "s": 96.88}, {"w": "marked", "s": 97.18}, {"w": "on", "s": 97.7}, {"w": "things", "s": 97.92}, {"w": "the", "s": 98.34}, {"w": "course", "s": 98.5}, {"w": "hadn’t", "s": 98.86}, {"w": "taught", "s": 99.18}, {"w": "them.", "s": 99.46}]}, {"start": 100.1, "end": 102.68, "text": "That’s why I introduced the catalogue.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 100.1}, {"w": "why", "s": 100.36}, {"w": "I", "s": 100.96}, {"w": "introduced", "s": 101.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 102.0}, {"w": "catalogue.", "s": 102.16}]}, {"start": 103.48, "end": 109.66, "text": "And from now on, I want the site to check those limits automatically whenever I update it.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 103.48}, {"w": "from", "s": 103.64}, {"w": "now", "s": 103.86}, {"w": "on,", "s": 104.14}, {"w": "I", "s": 104.92}, {"w": "want", "s": 105.08}, {"w": "the", "s": 105.34}, {"w": "site", "s": 105.52}, {"w": "to", "s": 105.78}, {"w": "check", "s": 105.98}, {"w": "those", "s": 106.22}, {"w": "limits", "s": 106.56}, {"w": "automatically", "s": 107.3}, {"w": "whenever", "s": 108.44}, {"w": "I", "s": 109.0}, {"w": "update", "s": 109.16}, {"w": "it.", "s": 109.54}]}]}